69
00:06:13.766 --> 00:06:15.165
Si Sung Jae ito!

70
00:06:22.677 --> 00:06:23.916
Sung Jae, dito!

71
00:06:43.536 --> 00:06:45.654
Bakit kailangan mong pumunta muli sa Han River?

72
